/T (Churn risk is a behavioral proxy built from three independent signals: thin purchase history \(bottom 25%\), low satisfaction \(rating < 3.2\), and high promo dependency \(score > 0.75\). Customers triggering 3 signals = High Risk.)
/E (Churn risk is a behavioral proxy built from three independent signals: thin purchase history \(bottom 25%\), low satisfaction \(rating < 3.2\), and high promo dependency \(score > 0.75\). Customers triggering 3 signals = High Risk.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
